abstract: "Reproducibility materials for a design-aware model-level verification and validation protocol on PISA 2022 mathematics, including plausible-value pooling, Fay-BRR uncertainty, calibration/fairness diagnostics, a matched additive EBM comparison, and unseen-school cold-start validation."
